<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina auctions 91-, 182-day bills.</title>
<headline>Argentina auctions 91-, 182-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina Tuesday auctioned 250 million pesos in 91-day Letes treasury bills at 5.6 percent and 250 million pesos in 182-day bills at 6.1 percent, the Economy Ministry said.</p>
<p>There were 66 bids on the 91-day bills for a bid-to-cover ratio of 4.11 times and 44 bids on the 182-day bills for a bid-to-cover ratio of 3.27 times.  </p>
<p>Market makers will be offered up to 10 percent more of both issues until 1615 local/1915 GMT.</p>
<p>Settlement is due July 18.</p>
<p>((Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618))</p>
